# 8. Final Verification Checklist

### Authentication

* [ ] Registration works
* [ ] Login works
* [ ] Logout works
* [ ] Invalid authentication is rejected

### Student

* [ ] Student can create complaint
* [ ] Student sees own complaints
* [ ] Student cannot access another student's complaint
* [ ] Student can track timeline
* [ ] Student can chat with assigned staff
* [ ] Student can close only Resolved complaint
* [ ] Student can submit feedback after closure

### Staff

* [ ] Staff sees assigned complaints
* [ ] Staff cannot see another staff member's complaint
* [ ] Staff can update status
* [ ] Staff can add remarks
* [ ] Staff can mark Resolved
* [ ] Staff cannot close complaints
* [ ] Staff can chat with complaint owner

### Admin

* [ ] Admin sees all complaints
* [ ] Admin can see student phone
* [ ] Admin can assign staff
* [ ] Assignment changes complaint workflow correctly

### Notifications

* [ ] Notifications are generated
* [ ] Notification badge works
* [ ] Individual notification can be marked read
* [ ] All notifications can be marked read

### Chat

* [ ] Authorized student can access chat
* [ ] Assigned staff can access chat
* [ ] Unauthorized staff cannot access chat
* [ ] Unauthorized student cannot access chat
* [ ] Closed chat history remains visible
* [ ] New messages are blocked after closure

### XML

* [ ] XML export works
* [ ] XSD validation succeeds
* [ ] DTD validation succeeds

### Database

* [ ] Database imports successfully
* [ ] Foreign keys work
* [ ] Complaint status history is stored
* [ ] Assignment history is stored
* [ ] Feedback is stored
* [ ] Timestamps are recorded correctly

